| Field | Schema clause | Valid coverage | Invalid coverage |
|---|---|---|---|
| `schema_version` | `properties.schema_version.const` | all 16 | `I14`† |
| `id` | `$ref: node_id` | all 16 | — |
| `kind` | `properties.kind.pattern` | all 16 (V15 = `constitution_clause`) | — |
| `status` | `$ref: status` | **all 7 values** across V01-V16 | `I08` |
| `content` | `minProperties: 1` | all 16 | — |
| `content_hash` | `$ref: sha256` | all 16 | `I14`, `I15` |
| `created_at` | `$ref: timestamp` | all 16 | — |
| `updated_at` | `$ref: timestamp` | all 16 | — |
| `provenance` | `$ref: provenance` (5 sub-fields) | all 16; `source.type` variants in V02, V15 | `I20` |
| `confidence` | `$ref: confidence` (5 sub-fields) | all 16; all 4 methods — V04 `court_ratified`, V05 `evidence_weighted`, V16 `ancestor_min`, V02 `decay_adjusted` | `I01`-`I04`, `I21` |
| `evidence_refs` | conditional `minItems` | V01 empty; V03-V16 non-empty | `I19` |
| `promotion` | `$ref: promotion` (7 sub-fields) | V03-V16 (14 edges); `note` in V13 | `I05`-`I07`, `I11`, `I17`, `I18` |
| `derived_from` | array of `node_id` | V02, V16 | — |
| `trust_zone` | `$ref: trust_zone` | Z2 base; Z0 in V15 | `I16`, `I20` |
| `labels` | `propertyNames.pattern` | V02, V15 | — |
| `superseded_by` | `$ref: node_id`, `INV-DEL-2` | V07, V08 | `I12` |
| `retraction` | `$ref: retraction` (5 sub-fields) | V09, V10 (`successor` in V10) | `I10`, `I13` |
| `quarantine` | `$ref: quarantine` (5 sub-fields) | V11 (`canary_id` present) | `I22` |
