## 4. Successor goals named by this design

Named here so that every deferral in this package resolves to something, rather than trailing off.

| Goal | Scope | Referenced from |
|---|---|---|
| **F-NODE-KINDS** | per-`kind` `content` schemas | `assumptions.md` A2 |
| **F-INVARIANTS** | `sakg/schema/invariants.py`, L2 rules | `design.md` §2.2, §3 above |
| **F-STORE** | append-only store, transition history | §3 above |
| **F-CONFIDENCE** | the derivation engine behind `confidence.method` | §3 above |
| **F-DEDUP** | `content_hash` collision policy | §3 above |
| **F-EDGES** | inter-node relationships beyond lineage | `assumptions.md` §5 |

